PASS d5-1a: omega^2 = 1, omega^T = omega, Tr omega = 0, omega anticommutes with e_a; the 12 tower generators satisfy the Clifford relations of R^{6,6} (integer exact)
PASS d5-1b: the 4096 blades of the 12 generators are signed permutation matrices, every non-identity blade is traceless, hence they are trace-orthogonal and span M_64(R): Cl(6,6) = M_64(R)
PASS d5-1c: graded tensor rule: for all 64 x 64 pairs, e^(1)_I e^(2)_J = (e_I omega^{|J|}) (x) e_J and e^(2)_J e^(1)_I = (-1)^{|I||J|} e^(1)_I e^(2)_J (the Klein / Jordan-Wigner sign)
PASS d5-1d: the Klein factor is forced: the blades commuting with all e_a (x) 1 are exactly 64, each +-1 (x) e_J (the commutant 1 (x) M_8); those anticommuting with all are 64, each +-omega (x) e_J
PASS d5-1e: Fock reading: n+-_i = (e_i +- e_{i+3})/2 satisfy the CAR of 3 modes at n=1 and, with the tower, of 6 modes at n=2 (copy-2 modes = omega (x) n+-: Jordan-Wigner strings); N_i = (1 - omega_i)/2 with omega_i = e_i e_{i+3}; spec N = 0..6 with multiplicities 1,6,15,20,15,6,1; (-1)^{N_1} = -omega (x) 1
PASS d5-1f: exchange of the constituents: the Koszul swap tau_K = D tau conjugates e^(1)_a <-> e^(2)_a, tau_K^2 = 1, Tr tau_K = 0 (32 + 32), and tau_K = g_1 g_2 ... g_6 exactly (the volume of the relative half); the naive swap does not implement the exchange
PASS d5-2a: f_a = (e^(1)_a + e^(2)_a)/sqrt2 and g_a = (e^(1)_a - e^(2)_a)/sqrt2: {f_a,f_b} = {g_a,g_b} = 2 eta_ab, {f_a, g_b} = 0 for all a, b: Cl(6,6) = Cl(f) (graded x) Cl(g)
PASS d5-2b: the copy rotation C_b = (1/2) sum_a eta_aa e^(1)_a e^(2)_a acts by e^(1) -> -e^(2), e^(2) -> e^(1); its spin lift through pi/4 carries e^(1)_a -> g_a, e^(2)_a -> f_a (float, 1e-12); C_b = -(1/2) sum eta_aa f_a g_a; exp(2 pi C_b) = 1
PASS d5-2c: what the halves carry: sum_k e^(k)_1 = sqrt2 f_1 (the duplicated clock), sum_k e^(k)_a e^(k)_b = f_a f_b + g_a g_b for all a < b (diagonal l_int, l_G, J_1 + J_2 split without cross terms), G_2 preserves span f and span g, tau_K commutes with every f_a and anticommutes with every g_a, and anticommutes with the copy rotations C_b and M_12 (exchange reverses copy charge)
